  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: lena
  title: Every House on the Street
  summary: 'Lena is drawing every house on the street for a picture book and asks Sam to write the words. A big publisher, Sterling Media, wants it, if she makes the street ''less shabby'' and puts the tower in the background. Fork: print fifty copies at the Kims'', or sign the big deal.'
  pathAName: Print fifty copies
  pathBName: Sign with the big publisher
  parts:
